# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Recorded macros - TREAT AS SECRETS.
#
# A macro is a literal keystroke log: src/models/macro.py stores each key as
# the character that was actually typed. Any macro recorded while a password,
# card number, recovery phrase or private message was on the keyboard contains
# that text verbatim, in plaintext.
#
# By default macros live in ~/Documents/AdvancedMacroTool/macros, outside this repo.
# These rules exist because the storage directory is user-configurable in
# Settings and can be pointed anywhere - including here.
#
# Do not relax these patterns to commit a "harmless" sample macro. Hand-write
# the JSON instead, so nothing that touched a real keyboard is ever published.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
macros/
*.macro.json
Untitled-*.json

# App settings - contains this machine's absolute macro-storage path.
settings.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts - these leak the build machine's absolute paths.
#
# PyInstaller writes the full path of every analysed file into build/*.toc and
# xref-build.html, e.g.
#   C:\Users\<name>\AppData\Roaming\Python\Python314\site-packages\...
# which discloses the OS username, Python version, install layout, and an
# inventory of every installed package. build/ alone is ~41 MB.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
*.spec.bak
*.exe
*.pkg
*.pyz
*.toc
xref-build.html
warn-build.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python bytecode - .pyc files embed the compile-time absolute source path in
# co_filename, which leaks the OS username and folder layout.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.python-version

# Packaging / tooling caches
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
pip-wheel-metadata/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local tool and editor state - machine-specific, often path-bearing.
# .claude/settings.local.json accumulates local tool-permission grants.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# Logs, crash dumps, scratch files
*.log
*.dmp
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*.rej
